      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还有褐藻糖胶、海藻酸、钙质、\n钾、碘……海带堪称是\n完美的健康食物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "273e17b0cba0c960e22dc48c2a73f95c9372333e1641a4601ea1e811e7e804bf",
